message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below (see preferred-citation)."
type: software
title: "Proof-or-Stop"
abstract: >-
  Evidence-gated control layer for unattended agent development: every
  lifecycle advance — phase transition, review pass, done, merge-readiness —
  must present fresh, code-state-bound, mechanically verifiable evidence,
  or the loop repairs, degrades honestly, or stops.
